				"code" : "| view |\nview := GtPhlowColumnedListView new.\nview items: [ {\n\t{ 'OSV REST (/v1/query, /v1/querybatch)'. 'no (needs package)'. 'no'. 'none'. 'full OSV corpus per package' }.\n\t{ 'OSV bulk feed (GCS)'. 'YES'. 'YES (via modified_id.csv)'. 'none'. 'full OSV corpus, every ecosystem' }.\n\t{ 'NVD v2 REST'. 'no (no ecosystem concept)'. 'YES (pubStartDate / lastModStartDate)'. 'key-friendly'. 'CPE-shaped only' }.\n\t{ 'GitHub GraphQL securityVulnerabilities'. 'YES (one at a time)'. 'no on this query; securityAdvisories has publishedSince but no ecosystem'. 'token'. 'GHSA subset only' }\n} ].\nview column: 'API' text: [ :row | row first ] weight: 2.\nview column: 'Ecosystem-only?' text: [ :row | row second ] weight: 1.3.\nview column: 'Date filter?' text: [ :row | row third ] weight: 1.6.\nview column: 'Auth?' text: [ :row | row fourth ] weight: 0.7.\nview column: 'Coverage' text: [ :row | row fifth ] weight: 1.5.\nview asElement",
