				},
				"string" : "# Design: `Gt4SecurityOsvFeedClient` (new class)\n\nA separate client from {{gtClass:Gt4SecurityOsvClient}} because the semantics differ: the REST client is per-package and synchronous; the feed client is ecosystem-level, range-based, and needs caching. Keeping them split avoids polluting the REST API class with bulk-fetch state.\n\n## Ivars\n- `baseUrl` — defaults to `https://storage.googleapis.com/osv-vulnerabilities`\n- `cacheDirectory` — file reference for on-disk cache (default: user temp / `gt4security-osv-feed/`)\n- `cachedModifiedIds` — in-memory parsed view of the latest `modified_id.csv` (row array) with its `Last-Modified` header\n- `history` — list of `Gt4SecurityOsvFeedCall` records (mirror of {{gtClass:Gt4SecurityOsvClient}}'s history pattern) for inspector visibility\n"
			},
			{
