				"string" : "\"Core: recent changes in an allowlist of ecosystems\"\nfeedClient recentSince: aDate ecosystems: #('npm' 'PyPI' 'crates.io')\n  \"→ Gt4SecurityVulnerabilityGroup\"\n\n\"Convenience: all ecosystems (careful — can be large)\"\nfeedClient recentSince: aDate\n\n\"Full per-ecosystem dump (opt-in for large ones)\"\nfeedClient ecosystemFull: 'crates.io'\nfeedClient ecosystemFull: 'npm' acceptLargeDownload: true\n\n\"Individual lookup — no zip, just one HTTP GET\"\nfeedClient fetchEcosystem: 'npm' id: 'GHSA-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx'"
