				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "# Integration with `Gt4SecurityQuery`\n\n{{gtClass:Gt4SecurityQuery}} already fans out to NVD + OSV per-package. Add a third fan-out lane for feeds:\n\n- `Gt4SecurityQuery >> feedRecentSince: aDate ecosystems: anEcosystemArray` — appends a feed spec to the query (stores as `(since, ecosystems)` pair)\n- `Gt4SecurityQuery >> feedClient` / `feedClient:` — injectable like the other clients\n- `Gt4SecurityQuery >> run` — add the feed fan-out step before dedup\n- {{gtClass:Gt4SecurityQueryResult}} — extend provenance with `feedCount` alongside `nvdCount` / `osvCount`\n\nExample calling pattern:\n\n```\n| q result |\nq := Gt4SecurityQuery new.\nq feedRecentSince: Date today - 7 days\n  ecosystems: #('npm' 'PyPI' 'crates.io').\nq limit: 50.\nresult := q run.\n\"→ Gt4SecurityQueryResult with provenance for all three lanes\"\n```\n\nThe existing id+alias dedup logic already works regardless of source — nothing needs to change there."
			},
			{
