				},
				"string" : "# Test strategy\n\n**Offline (CI-safe)**:\n- Synthetic `modified_id.csv` parsing (`<gtExample>`)\n- Stub feed client returning canned rows + canned JSONs, exercising `recentSince:ecosystems:`\n- Zip parse from a fixture file with 3 synthetic vuln JSONs inside\n- `Gt4SecurityQuery >> feedRecentSince:ecosystems:` with an injected stub feed client\n\n**Live (`<noTest>`)**:\n- Single-vuln lookup on a well-known GHSA id\n- Actual `modified_id.csv` fetch + row count assertion (> 0)\n- Last 7 days npm live, asserts all returned vulns have `primaryEcosystem = 'npm'`\n- Cross-ecosystem (npm + PyPI + crates.io) last 7 days\n- Full crates.io dump (small enough for occasional live runs)\n\nAll offline `<gtExample>`s must pass in the same sweep we use today (33 currently)."
			},
